-- What proceeding on each stated intention does (Article 9(5) limbs).
#ASSERT `Art 9(7)(b) the consequence of proceeding on the intention` `intention (a)(i)` EQUALS `the application is treated as withdrawn`
#ASSERT `Art 9(7)(b) the consequence of proceeding on the intention` `intention (a)(ii)` EQUALS `the application is treated as an application for entry in the general section, on provision of any further information and evidence required`
#ASSERT `Art 9(7)(b) the consequence of proceeding on the intention` `intention (b)(i)` EQUALS `the charity remains registered in the general section`
#ASSERT `Art 9(7)(b) the consequence of proceeding on the intention` `intention (b)(ii)` EQUALS `the charity is treated as applying to be deregistered, on provision of any further information and evidence required`

